, "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "02 输入要说的台词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [430, 230], "pos": [40, 580], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [303], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [510, 450], "pos": [1280, 300], "widgets_values": ["subject_definitions:\n<Audio 1> is the voice identity reference for the only speaker (S1). Preserve the original recognizable timbre, resonance and vocal texture.\n\nsummary:\n[single-speaker speech generation + audio reference] S1 speaks new Mandarin dialogue using the voice from <Audio 1>. One speaker only, natural clear speech, no singing.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Audio 1>: reference for vocal identity only. Do not repeat the source words or background noise. Generate pacing and pauses from the target dialogue.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Audio Segment 1]\nS1 speaks naturally with clear articulation and relaxed expression. Maintain the same voice throughout. Say the following words exactly once, without reading section labels or adding dialogue:\n<d>[Chinese] {a}</d>\nFinish with a short natural silence.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nClean close-recorded speech. No background chatter or sound effects.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "values.a", "link": 302, "label": "values.a", "type": "*", "localized_name": "a"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "values.b", "label": "values.b", "type": "*", "localized_name": "b"}, {"widget": {"name": "f_string"}, "name": "f_string", "label": "f_string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "f_string"}], "flags": {}, "id": 151, "type": "StringFormat", "title": "自动组合音色提示词", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "StringFormat"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links"